    "background_story": "Cookie was a free-spirited cat who lived life on her own terms. However, when she met her new owner, Emma, she surprisingly adapted to her new surroundings conformably. Emma, a tidy and organized person, had a strict routine for her pets. Cookie, to everyone's surprise, took to the routine like a pro. She learned to wake up at the same time every morning, eat at the same hour, and even sleep in her designated bed. Cookie's ability to conform to Emma's lifestyle was a testament to her flexibility and desire to please. As a result, she earned the title of 'best-behaved cat in the neighborhood.' Despite her newfound love for routine, Cookie still managed to sneak in the occasional cuddle session and playtime, proving that even the most conforming cat can still have a playful side.",
